      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Unclear – the revenue model is solely based on access codes, which lacks a strong foundation. Sustainability depends on user adoption.",
      "Differentiation": "• Weak – the app largely replicates existing video analysis tools with a mobile interface. The ‘AI’ component isn’t clearly differentiated.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Limited – The ‘health and wellness disclaimer’ and lack of specific evidence beyond the demo raise concerns about the app’s actual impact.",
      "Risk Awareness and Mitigation": "• Adequate – The team acknowledges typical software risks and offers a contingency plan, but the fulfillment risk (minor delays) is understated."
    },
    "Project B": {
      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Strong – the core value proposition of verifiable digital provenance is well-defined and addresses a significant problem in the digital landscape.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Large – the need for trust and authenticity in supply chains and ethical sourcing is growing, targeting procurement teams and certification bodies.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Moderate – The technical approach (SHA-256, Merkle tree) is sound, but the plan is complex and relies on several interconnected components (witness network, verification widget).",
      "Revenue Model and Sustainability": "• Promising – a subscription service model is a reasonable approach for providing access to the ledger and advanced features.",
      "Differentiation": "• Strong – The focus on a machine-readable registry of ethical standards and the heirloom-quality goods concept offers a genuine differentiator.",
      "Impact and Evidence Plan": "• Good – The proposed test ledger, pilot program, and public report demonstrate a commitment to transparency and validation.",
      "Risk Awareness and Mitigation": "• Moderate – The plan to establish a witness consortium introduces complexity and potential delays. The reliance on a hypothetical partner (Patagonia) is also a risk."
    }
